+ * the display's qxm_mdp0. For Coachz's boe,nv110wtm-n61 (sc7180-trogdor-coachz.dtsi), panel-edp.c's 60 Hz mode has 2160 active
+ * columns and 1440 + 3 + 6 + 31 total lines. _dpu_plane_calc_bw uses width * vtotal * fps * cpp; prefill uses 24/(vbp + vsync),
